---
title: "Presentation Software (PowerPoint, Zoom)"
code: "AST-260"
category: "office-management"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Teaches creation of slides including use of text, clip art, and graphs. Includes techniques for enhancing presentations with on-screen slide shows as well as printing to transparencies and hand-outs. Incorporates use of sound and video clips. Lecture 3 hours per week.
